<![CDATA[
    <p>E hoje é dia de <strong><em>MacMagazine no Ar</em></strong>! 😃 Esta é a <strong>654ª edição</strong> do nosso podcast.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="participantes-do-dia">Participantes do dia</h2><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>Rafael Fischmann</strong> [<a href="https://x.com/rfischmann" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@rfischmann</a>]</li><li><strong>Eduardo Marques</strong> [<a href="https://x.com/eduardomarques" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@eduardomarques</a>]</li><li><strong>Bruno Cardoso</strong> [<a href="https://x.com/brnocrdoso" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@brnocrdoso</a>]</li></ul><p>A edição é obra do <strong>Eduardo Garcia</strong> [<a href="https://t.me/edugarcya" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@edugarcya</a>].</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="pauta-do-episodio">Pauta do episódio</h2><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><code>00:00:00</code> Introdução</li><li><code>00:09:37</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/10/20/beta-4-do-ios-26-1-inclui-opcao-para-alterar-a-aparencia-do-liquid-glass/">Beta 4 do iOS 26.1 inclui opção para alterar a aparência do Liquid Glass</a></li><li><code>00:21:02</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/10/20/nova-siri-estaria-com-problemas-de-desempenho-em-testes-do-ios-26-4/">Nova Siri estaria com problemas de desempenho em testes do iOS 26.4</a></li><li><code>00:29:06</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/10/16/apple-prepara-macbooks-pro-com-telas-oled-sensiveis-ao-toque-chip-m6-e-novo-design-para-2026-diz-bloomberg/">Apple prepara MacBooks Pro com telas OLED sensíveis ao toque, chip “M6” e novo design para 2026, diz Bloomberg</a></li><li><code>00:36:34</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/10/21/peso-excessivo-e-outros-obstaculos-fazem-apple-adiar-ipad-fold-para-2029-diz-bloomberg/">Peso excessivo e outros obstáculos fazem Apple adiar “iPad Fold” para 2029, diz Bloomberg</a></li><li><code>00:41:52</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/10/20/alguns-iphones-17-pro-na-cor-laranja-cosmico-estao-ficando-rosas/">Alguns iPhones 17 Pro na cor laranja-cósmico estão ficando… rosas</a></li><li><code>00:57:38</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/10/17/apple-tv-transmitira-as-corridas-da-f1-de-forma-exclusiva-nos-eua-em-2026/">Apple TV transmitirá as corridas da F1 de forma exclusiva nos EUA em 2026</a></li><li><code>01:05:01</code> Encerramento</li></ul><div class="cnvs-block-tabs cnvs-block-tabs-1614379620098 cnvs-block-tabs-3"><div class="cnvs-block-tabs-buttons"><div class="cnvs-block-tabs-button cnvs-block-tabs-button-active"><a href="#">Ouça pelo SoundCloud</a></div><div class="cnvs-block-tabs-button"><a href="#">Ouça pelo Apple Podcasts</a></div><div class="cnvs-block-tabs-button"><a href="#">Ouça no Spotify</a></div>
    </div><div class="cnvs-block-tabs-content"><div class="cnvs-block-tab cnvs-block-tab-1614379620212"><div class="wp-block-canvas-tab cnvs-block-tab"></div></div><div class="cnvs-block-tab cnvs-block-tab-1614379620226"><div class="wp-block-canvas-tab cnvs-block-tab"><iframe src="https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/macmagazine-no-ar/id547137017?itsct=podcast_box&amp;itscg=30200" sandbox="allow-forms allow-popups allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation" allow="autoplay *; encrypted-media *;" style="width: 100%; max-width: 660px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 10px; background: transparent;" height="450px" frameborder="0"></iframe></div></div><div class="cnvs-block-tab cnvs-block-tab-1614379650178"><div class="wp-block-canvas-tab cnvs-block-tab"><iframe src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/show/52IrqJ0ZwPVp0kKXaOWnLP" style="height: 240px" width="300" height="380" frameborder="0"></iframe></div></div>

    </div></div><p>Nosso podcast está disponível <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/br/podcast/macmagazine-no-ar/id547137017?at=10lt3B" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">no <strong>Apple Podcasts</strong></a>, <a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/52IrqJ0ZwPVp0kKXaOWnLP#upsell" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">no <strong>Spotify</strong></a>, <a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLsHA-krxZsqicwZ2vnaUVfjDmr_iYxiEx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">no <strong>YouTube</strong></a>, <a href="https://music.amazon.com.br/podcasts/a7a91bcc-b81e-44c1-b6e8-fdb56c46ec5f?tag=macma08-20" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">no <strong>Amazon Music</strong></a>, <a href="https://www.deezer.com/br/show/13129" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">no <strong>Deezer</strong></a>, <a href="http://soundcloud.com/macmagazine" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">num perfil do portal <strong>SoundCloud</strong></a> ou diretamente <a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/feed/podcast/">num <em>feed</em><strong>RSS</strong></a>.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">APOIO: <a href="https://creators.insiderstore.com.br/MACMAGAZINE100" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Insider</a></h2><div class="wp-block-image is-style-default"><figure class="aligncenter size-full"><a href="https://creators.insiderstore.com.br/MACMAGAZINE100" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img decoding="async" width="1148" height="258" data-attachment-id="1111372" data-permalink="https://macmagazine.com.br/09-logo-insider/" data-orig-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/09-logo-insider.jpg" data-orig-size="1148,258" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;