<content:encoded>
<![CDATA[
    <p>E hoje é dia de <strong><em>MacMagazine no Ar</em></strong>! 😃 Esta é a <strong>653ª edição</strong> do nosso podcast.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="participantes-do-dia">Participantes do dia</h2><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>Rafael Fischmann</strong> [<a href="https://x.com/rfischmann" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@rfischmann</a>]</li><li><strong>Eduardo Marques</strong> [<a href="https://x.com/eduardomarques" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@eduardomarques</a>]</li></ul><p>A edição é obra do <strong>Eduardo Garcia</strong> [<a href="https://t.me/edugarcya" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@edugarcya</a>].</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="pauta-do-episodio">Pauta do episódio</h2><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><code>00:00</code> Introdução</li><li><code>06:14</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/10/15/apple-anuncia-segunda-geracao-do-vision-pro-com-chip-m5-e-nova-alca/">Apple anuncia segunda geração do Vision Pro com chip M5 e nova alça</a></li><li><code>16:30</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/10/15/apple-lanca-macbook-pro-de-14-com-chip-m5-e-mais-performance-em-tarefas-de-ia/">Apple lança MacBook Pro de 14″ com chip M5 e mais performance em tarefas de IA</a></li><li><code>22:29</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/10/15/novos-ipads-pro-sao-lancados-com-os-chips-m5-n1-e-c1x/">Novos iPads Pro são lançados com os chips M5, N1 e C1X</a></li><li><code>27:59</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/10/13/gurman-apple-ja-trabalha-no-chip-h3-e-nos-airpods-5-apple-glass-podera-rodar-o-visionos-mas-de-um-jeito-diferente/">Gurman: Apple já trabalha no chip “H3” e nos “AirPods 5”; “Apple Glass” poderá rodar o visionOS, mas de um jeito diferente</a></li><li><code>34:15</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/10/13/apple-tv-e-rebatizado-para-apple-tv/">Apple TV+ é rebatizado para… Apple TV</a></li><li><code>45:14</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/10/13/aplicativo-clips-e-descontinuado-silenciosamente-pela-apple/">Aplicativo Clips é descontinuado silenciosamente pela Apple</a></li><li><code>49:04</code> Encerramento</li></ul><div class="cnvs-block-tabs cnvs-block-tabs-1614379620098 cnvs-block-tabs-3"><div class="cnvs-block-tabs-buttons"><div class="cnvs-block-tabs-button cnvs-block-tabs-button-active"><a href="#">Ouça pelo SoundCloud</a></div><div class="cnvs-block-tabs-button"><a href="#">Ouça pelo Apple Podcasts</a></div><div class="cnvs-block-tabs-button"><a href="#">Ouça no Spotify</a></div>
    </div><div class="cnvs-block-tabs-content"><div class="cnvs-block-tab cnvs-block-tab-1614379620212"><div class="wp-block-canvas-tab cnvs-block-tab"></div></div><div class="cnvs-block-tab cnvs-block-tab-1614379620226"><div class="wp-block-canvas-tab cnvs-block-tab"><iframe src="https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/macmagazine-no-ar/id547137017?itsct=podcast_box&amp;itscg=30200" sandbox="allow-forms allow-popups allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation" allow="autoplay *; encrypted-media *;" style="width: 100%; max-width: 660px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 10px; background: transparent;" height="450px" frameborder="0"></iframe></div></div><div class="cnvs-block-tab cnvs-block-tab-1614379650178"><div class="wp-block-canvas-tab cnvs-block-tab"><iframe src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/show/52IrqJ0ZwPVp0kKXaOWnLP" style="height: 240px" width="300" height="380" frameborder="0"></iframe></div></div>

    </div></div><p>Nosso podcast está disponível <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/br/podcast/macmagazine-no-ar/id547137017?at=10lt3B" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">no <strong>Apple Podcasts</strong></a>, <a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/52IrqJ0ZwPVp0kKXaOWnLP#upsell" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">no <strong>Spotify</strong></a>, <a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLsHA-krxZsqicwZ2vnaUVfjDmr_iYxiEx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">no <strong>YouTube</strong></a>, <a href="https://music.amazon.com.br/podcasts/a7a91bcc-b81e-44c1-b6e8-fdb56c46ec5f?tag=macma08-20" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">no <strong>Amazon Music</strong></a>, <a href="https://www.deezer.com/br/show/13129" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">no <strong>Deezer</strong></a>, <a href="http://soundcloud.com/macmagazine" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">num perfil do portal <strong>SoundCloud</strong></a> ou diretamente <a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/feed/podcast/">num <em>feed</em><strong>RSS</strong></a>.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">APOIO: <a href="https://revolut.ngih.net/c/257351/3313732/9626" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Revolut</a></h2><div class="wp-block-image"><figure class="aligncenter size-full"><a href="https://revolut.ngih.net/c/257351/3313732/9626" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img decoding="async" width="3823" height="1000" data-attachment-id="1112121" data-permalink="https://macmagazine.com.br/14-logo-revolut/" data-orig-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/14-logo-revolut.jpeg" data-orig-size="3823,1000" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="Logo da Revoult" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-medium-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/14-logo-revolut-600x157.jpeg" data-large-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/14-logo-revolut-1260x330.jpeg" src="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/14-logo-revolut.jpeg" alt="Logo da Revoult" class="wp-image-1112121" srcset="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/14-logo-revolut.jpeg 3823w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/14-logo-revolut-600x157.jpeg 600w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/14-logo-revolut-1260x330.jpeg 1260w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/14-logo-revolut-1536x402.jpeg 1536w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/14-logo-revolut-2048x536.jpeg 2048w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/14-logo-revolut-550x144.jpeg 550w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/14-logo-revolut-800x209.jpeg 800w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/14-logo-revolut-1160x303.jpeg 1160w" sizes="(max-width: 3823px) 100vw, 3823px"></a></figure></div><p>Viajar com a <strong>Revolut</strong> é sinônimo de praticidade e economia. Com a conta global Revolut, você pode fazer câmbio instantâneo entre mais de 30 moedas, em mais de 160 países, com uma das taxas competitivas do mercado (0,6% dentro do horário comercial). Além disso, é possível usar o app para controlar seus gastos em tempo real, sacar dinheiro no exterior com segurança, fazer compras usando o seu cartão físico ou digital (compatível com o Apple Pay) e ainda aproveitar um bônus de 5% de<em>cashback</em> (limitado a R$100) na sua primeira operação de câmbio ao<a href="https://revolut.ngih.net/c/257351/3313732/9626" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">abrir a sua conta pelo link do <em>MacMagazine</em></a>.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Links citados na introdução</h2><div class="cnvs-block-posts cnvs-block-posts-1748035095461 cnvs-block-posts-layout-horizontal-type-1" data-layout="horizontal-type-1" data-min-height=""><div class="cs-posts-area" data-posts-area=""><div class="cs-posts-area__outer"><div class="cs-posts-area__main cs-block-posts-layout-horizontal-type-1 cs-posts-area__image-width-one-third"><article class="post-1110886 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-apple category-destaques category-mac category-software tag-acesso-pessoal tag-area-de-transferencia tag-atalhos tag-barra-de-menus tag-central-de-controle tag-dicas tag-dock tag-icones tag-janelas tag-mac tag-macos tag-macos-tahoe tag-macos-tahoe-26 tag-pastas tag-safari tag-shorcuts tag-sistema tag-sistema-operacional tag-tahoe tag-teclado tag-tela-bloqueada tag-textos tag-video cs-entry cs-video-wrap"><div class="cs-entry__outer"><div class="cs-entry__inner cs-entry__thumbnail cs-entry__overlay cs-overlay-ratio cs-ratio-landscape-16-9"><div class="cs-overlay-background cs-overlay-transparent"><img decoding="async" width="3840" height="2160" src="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/07-tahoe.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image" alt="" srcset="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/07-tahoe.jpg 3840w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/07-tahoe-600x338.jpg 600w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/07-tahoe-1260x709.jpg 1260w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/07-tahoe-300x169.jpg 300w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/07-tahoe-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/07-tahoe-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/07-tahoe-380x214.jpg 380w, https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/07-tahoe-550x309.jpg 550w, https://macmagazine.com.br