<![CDATA[
    <p>E hoje é dia de <strong><em>MacMagazine no Ar</em></strong>! 😃 Esta é a <strong>649ª edição</strong> do nosso podcast.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="participantes-do-dia">Participantes do dia</h2><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>Rafael Fischmann</strong> [<a href="https://x.com/rfischmann" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@rfischmann</a>]</li><li><strong>Eduardo Marques</strong> [<a href="https://x.com/eduardomarques" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@eduardomarques</a>]</li></ul><p>A edição é obra do <strong>Eduardo Garcia</strong> [<a href="https://t.me/edugarcya" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@edugarcya</a>].</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="pauta-do-episodio">Pauta do episódio</h2><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><code>00:00</code> Introdução</li><li><code>08:19</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/09/15/ios-26-e-ipados-26-sao-liberados-com-liquid-glass-novos-apps-e-outras-novidades/">iOS 26 e iPadOS 26 são liberados com Liquid Glass, novos apps e outras novidades</a></li><li><code>15:31</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/09/15/app-do-macmagazine-ganha-update-com-nova-interface-liquid-glass/">App do MacMagazine ganha update com nova interface Liquid Glass!</a></li><li><code>18:17</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/09/12/monitoramento-de-hipertensao-do-apple-watch-e-aprovado-pela-fda-nos-estados-unidos/">Monitoramento de hipertensão do Apple Watch é aprovado pela FDA nos Estados Unidos</a></li><li><code>24:03</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/09/16/apple-inicia-a-pre-venda-dos-iphones-17-e-air-no-brasil/">Apple inicia a pré-venda dos iPhones 17 e Air no Brasil</a></li><li><code>27:14</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/09/15/apple-ainda-tem-pelo-menos-10-novos-produtos-a-caminho-apos-os-iphones-17-e-air-diz-mark-gurman/">Apple ainda tem pelo menos 10 novos produtos a caminho após os iPhones 17 e Air, diz Mark Gurman</a></li><li><code>34:05</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/09/17/macbook-pro-com-oled-tambem-podera-ter-tela-sensivel-ao-toque/">MacBook Pro com OLED também poderá ter tela sensível ao toque</a></li><li><code>41:25</code><a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/09/15/apple-tv-fatura-22-estatuetas-nos-emmy-awards-de-2025-o-estudio-e-ruptura-sao-os-destaques/">Apple TV+ fatura 22 estatuetas nos Emmy Awards de 2025; “O Estúdio” e “Ruptura” são os destaques</a></li><li><code>47:33</code> Encerramento</li></ul><div class="cnvs-block-tabs cnvs-block-tabs-1614379620098 cnvs-block-tabs-3"><div class="cnvs-block-tabs-buttons"><div class="cnvs-block-tabs-button cnvs-block-tabs-button-active"><a href="#">Ouça pelo SoundCloud</a></div><div class="cnvs-block-tabs-button"><a href="#">Ouça pelo Apple Podcasts</a></div><div class="cnvs-block-tabs-button"><a href="#">Ouça no Spotify</a></div>
    </div><div class="cnvs-block-tabs-content"><div class="cnvs-block-tab cnvs-block-tab-1614379620212"><div class="wp-block-canvas-tab cnvs-block-tab"></div></div><div class="cnvs-block-tab cnvs-block-tab-1614379620226"><div class="wp-block-canvas-tab cnvs-block-tab"><iframe src="https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/macmagazine-no-ar/id547137017?itsct=podcast_box&amp;itscg=30200" sandbox="allow-forms allow-popups allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation" allow="autoplay *; encrypted-media *;" style="width: 100%; max-width: 660px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 10px; background: transparent;" height="450px" frameborder="0"></iframe></div></div><div class="cnvs-block-tab cnvs-block-tab-1614379650178"><div class="wp-block-canvas-tab cnvs-block-tab"><iframe src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/show/52IrqJ0ZwPVp0kKXaOWnLP" style="height: 240px" width="300" height="380" frameborder="0"></iframe></div></div>

    </div></div><p>Nosso podcast está disponível <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/br/podcast/macmagazine-no-ar/id547137017?at=10lt3B" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">no <strong>Apple Podcasts</strong></a>, <a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/52IrqJ0ZwPVp0kKXaOWnLP#upsell" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">no <strong>Spotify</strong></a>, <a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLsHA-krxZsqicwZ2vnaUVfjDmr_iYxiEx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">no <strong>YouTube</strong></a>, <a href="https://music.amazon.com.br/podcasts/a7a91bcc-b81e-44c1-b6e8-fdb56c46ec5f?tag=macma08-20" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">no <strong>Amazon Music</strong></a>, <a href="https://www.deezer.com/br/show/13129" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">no <strong>Deezer</strong></a>, <a href="http://soundcloud.com/macmagazine" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">num perfil do portal <strong>SoundCloud</strong></a> ou diretamente <a href="https://macmagazine.com.br/feed/podcast/">num <em>feed</em><strong>RSS</strong></a>.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide"><h2 class="wp-block-heading cnvs-block-core-heading-1685032742050">Apoio: <a href="https://nordvpn.com/macmagazine" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NordVPN</a> e<a href="https://www.anrdoezrs.net/click-7334683-15565796" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Workspace</a></h2><div class="wp-block-image"><figure class="alignright size-full is-resized"><a href="https://nordvpn.com/macmagazine" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img decoding="async" width="720" height="158" data-attachment-id="1103713" data-permalink="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2025/09/06/como-acompanhar-a-keynote-awe-dropping-na-proxima-terca-feira-9-9/05-logo-nordvpn/" data-orig-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/05-logo-nordvpn.png" data-orig-size="720,158" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;: