</div><h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="gravacao-ao-vivo">Gravação ao vivo</h2><p>Todas as nossas gravações do podcast são transmitidas ao vivo pelo YouTube, com interação via <em>(Super) Chats</em>.</p><figure class="wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper"><iframe title="MacMagazine no Ar #640 (gravação ao vivo)" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/agse-XodtIY?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></figure><hr><div class="appbox"><div class="appbox-icon"><a href="http://bit.ly/mmnoar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img decoding="async" src="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/capa-600x600.png" alt="Capa do podcast - MacMagazine no Ar" width="600" height="600"></a></div><div class="appbox-details"><span class="appbox-name"><a href="http://bit.ly/mmnoar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MacMagazine no Ar</a></span><span class="appbox-de">de <strong>MacMagazine</strong></span><span><small><strong>Episódio:</strong> #640<br><strong>Gravação:</strong> 17 de julho de 2025<br><strong>Duração:</strong> 48min39<br><strong>Trilha sonora:</strong><a href="https://music.apple.com/br/artist/jamie-xx/405563985?at=10lt3B" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jamie xx</a></small></span></div><div class="appbox-badge"><span><a href="https://apple.co/2HrhKQi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img decoding="async" data-attachment-id="598748" data-permalink="https://macmagazine.com.br/post/2017/04/13/apple-da-mais-um-passo-de-distancia-do-itunes-com-o-novo-nome-apple-podcasts/13-podcasts_badge/" data-orig-file="https://macmagazine.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/13-podcasts_badge.png" data-orig-size="750,197